cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "tgx-monitor: monitoring and alerting for the TGX web estate"
message: "If you reuse this, please cite it."
type: software
abstract: >-
  Monitors the web services, SPARQL endpoints, data releases, scheduled jobs, backups
  and infrastructure of the Department of Translational Genomics at Maastricht
  University on a two-node Docker Swarm. It checks presence, features, data shapes,
  API round trips and freshness rather than only whether a port answers, routes
  alerts to the owner of each service as GitHub issues, e-mail and Slack, and
  publishes a public status page.
authors:
  - given-names: Marvin
    family-names: Martens
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2230-0840"
    affiliation: "Department of Translational Genomics, Maastricht University"
repository-code: "https://github.com/TGX-UM/tgx-monitor"
url: "https://status.cloud.vhp4safety.nl/"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
